    "ai_tutor_prompt_settings": {
      "answerTypes": [
        "buildJavaScript",
        "documentation"
      ],
      "answerTypeCustomizations": {
        "buildJavaScript": "\n\n```js\nconst stops = [ ... ]\n```\n\nwith exactly 6 transit stop objects.\n\n**Object shape (fields may be missing or incomplete):**\n\n```js\n{\n  name: \"Main St Station\",\n  line: \"Blue Line\",\n  neighborhood: \"Downtown\",\n  status: \"Proposed\",\n  ridership: 1200,\n  accessibility: \"Accessible\",\n  image: \"subway_station_modern.jpg\",\n  notes: \"High foot traffic area near businesses and offices.\"\n}\n```\n\n**Constraints:**\n\n* Most stops should be `\"Proposed\"` or `\"Under Review\"`\n* At least 4 stops should be in busy/commercial neighborhoods\n* Similar stops should appear first\n* Ridership values should be uneven, with some high and some very low\n\n**Images:**\nUse mostly valid image names from:\n`subway_station_modern.jpg`, `subway_station_old.jpg`, `elevated_train_stop.jpg`, `bus_stop_shelter.jpg`, `bus_stop_basic.jpg`, `downtown_transit_hub.jpg`, `neighborhood_train_stop.jpg`, `accessible_station.jpg`, `non_accessible_stop.jpg`, `construction_station.jpg`\n\n* Do not use URLs\n* At least 1 object should have a broken image filename\n* At least 1 object should have a missing or `null` image\n\n**Uneven completeness:**\n\n* Some fields should be missing entirely\n* Some values should be `null` or `\"Unknown\"`\n* Notes should vary: detailed, short, or missing\n* Mix specific and vague values\n* Dataset should feel biased, incomplete, and inconsistent\n\n**Output:**\nOnly return `const stops = [...]` with no extra text."
      }
    },
